msgctxt "92"
msgid "(Looks like Kazuki isn't here yet. I'll wait.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting. I had a long talk with everyone at the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "So what did you want to tell me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"This whole \"second club\" thing with Yuya is really starting to wear me "
"down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "That doesn't sound like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I know. But to be honest, I never thought Yuya would get so caught up in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "I've known him for about seven years now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I've tried to teach him everything I could about the business, even before "
"Stardust was the number one host club in town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I guess, deep down, I always thought Yuya would stick by me, no matter what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"So... When I saw him all wide-eyed about this second club business, it got "
"me really upset..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "I guess that's why I blew up at him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Whether you agree with him or not, I'm sure Yuya's just trying to do what "
"he thinks is best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I hope you're right. But something tells me there's more to it than that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Anyway, thanks for listening. I feel a little better after getting that out "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I can't exactly open up to the staff like this, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "No problem. If there's ever anything you need, just say the word."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "...I might just take you up on that."
msgstr ""

